1. Scan for new disks
2. fdisk /dev/emcpower?? {n,p,1,x,b,128,w}
3. pvcreate /dev/emcpower??1
4. vgextend <VG> /dev/emcpower??1
5. lvconvert -m 1 --mirrorlog core /dev/<vg>/<LV>  /dev/emcpower??1
6. lvconvert -m 0 /dev/<vg>/<LV>  <old disk>1
7. lvextend -L +<size>G /dev/<VG>/<LV>
8. resize2fs /dev/<VG>/<LV>
9. vgreduce <VG> <old disk>1
10. powermt remove dev=<old disk>
11. Put new clone group name into pcra01bk3 CloneList.txt file

